ていきます。歳をとると加速度的に忘れていきます。 そしてヤバいのは、分かっていることと、分かっていないこと、できること、できないことの区別がつかなくなることです。 人は分かる範囲でしか物事を理解しないので、「分かっていないことを知る」という行為を行なって「分かる…","image_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41x2yjqyooS._SL500_.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1630690781,"service_name":"Magnolia Tech","service_icon":"https://blog.magnolia.tech/icon/touch","from_url":"https://blog.magnolia.tech/entry/2021/09/04/023941","original_url":"https://blog.magnolia.tech/entry/2021/09/04/023941"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"java","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l/8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ef2d4ce-8d8c-4226-920f-f5f473ef1129","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"「闇が闇を取り込んだら頭がおかしくなって死ぬ」だった\nブロント語難しい","ts":"1630835656.447300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OPaRp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd0262a2-37c3-4705-9c0a-7143d3fb73f3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"光が闇を取り込んだら最強になるけど闇が光を取り込んだら頭がおかしくなって死ぬやつ","ts":"1630835580.446300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OqsO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebf74c56-ded9-4c21-b0aa-317515d06e12","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最強に見える?","ts":"1630835544.445400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jzp0m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7e82bad-9e68-474c-987f-dcbc63a17d68","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"光と闇のVim as IDEをそれぞれ発表すれば……","ts":"1630835503.445200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hbJ8C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f25bc3d0-bcad-42d3-bc49-e0100e458182","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"草","ts":"1630835474.444900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":